<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 22.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gill (built 1978) 16,318 dwt Del Tema 25-30/11 redel USAC $2,500 daily Gernstar.</p>
<p>Jiao Cheng (built 1978) 16,250 dwt del New Orleans 1-5/12 redel S'pore/Japan $8,500 daily cnr.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
</text>
